  "body": "## What's Changed\n* build(deps): bump find-msvc-tools from 0.1.12 to 0.1.15 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15695\n* build(deps): bump indexmap from 2.14.0 to 2.14.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15689\n* build(deps): bump jiff from 0.2.35 to 0.2.46 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15687\n* build(deps): bump go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace from 1.44.0 to 1.47.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15788\n* build(deps): bump github.com/prometheus/common from 0.71.0 to 0.73.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15759\n* fix(destination): keep federated endpoints when a stream is torn down by @codenameraz in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15784\n* chore: add k8s level warning for malformed ports on annotation by @anthoturc in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15785\n* chore(build): update golang to 1.26.11 by @arichardet in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15815\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto to 0.59.0 by @arichardet in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15821\n* fix(viz): stat test by @raykroeker in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15823\n* fix(destination): Handle Server delete tombstones by @donaldraph in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15790\n* build(deps): bump http-body-util from 0.1.4 to 0.1.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15688\n\n## New Contributors\n* @codenameraz made their first contribution in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15784\n* @donaldraph made their first contribution in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15790\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/compare/edge-26.11.2...edge-26.11.3",
